OL,3,GNEWSAFour arrested after police pursuit
OL,4,
OL,5,FFour people have been arrested
OL,6,Ffollowing a police pursuit that led to
OL,7,Fearly morning motorway disruption.
OL,9,FWest Yorkshire Police said the pursuit
OL,10,Fended at junction 25 of the M62 near
OL,11,FBrighouse earlier. The circumstances of
OL,12,Fthe pursuit and details of those
OL,13,Farrested are yet to be confirmed.
OL,15,FMotorists travelling through the area
OL,16,Fare facing disruption with queuing
OL,17,Ftraffic.
OL,19,FAccording to traffic monitoring service
OL,20,FInrix, the westbound exit slip road
OL,21,Fremains closed.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
